# Intel GPU firmware, x86_64 only, on top of intel.list
# (rules/xxri-firmware-intel.make; the 32-bit system ships intel.list alone).
#
# Names are what i915 and xe declare (MODULE_FIRMWARE, scripts/xxri-fw-requested.sh),
# minus what intel.list has, resolved against linux-firmware 20260810 by
# scripts/xxri-fw-select.py. If a driver wants a newer API than the release
# has, the newest one the release has is named instead.
#
# Scope: Ice Lake up to Alder/Raptor Lake (DMC, GuC, HuC, GSC), Meteor Lake,
# DG1/DG2 (Arc A), Lunar Lake and Battlemage (xe).
i915/adlp_dmc_ver2_16.bin
i915/adlp_guc_69.0.3.bin
i915/adlp_guc_70.1.1.bin
i915/bmg_dmc.bin
i915/bxt_guc_70.1.1.bin
i915/bxt_huc_2.0.0.bin
i915/cml_guc_70.1.1.bin
i915/cml_huc_4.0.0.bin
i915/dg1_dmc_ver2_02.bin
i915/dg1_guc_70.bin
i915/dg1_huc.bin
